	(text "The AXP192 with its inputs (USB-C VBUS, the VIN pad, the battery, the backup cell), its DC-DC and LDO\noutputs, the power key with the RTC wake-up coupling, and the 5 V boost for the Grove port and the 5VOUT\npad.\n\nMain parts: U2 AXP192, J3 battery connector, BAT1 backup cell, S1 power key, U8 SGM6603-5.0"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
